#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:43
msgid "CSV Import Format"
msgstr "Formato de importación CSV"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:45
msgid ""
"Contacts can be created and updated in bulk with the *Import contacts* "
"option of the Address Book list menu. The dialog describes the format, "
"offers a downloadable CSV template and shows the result of every line. It is"
" only shown to administrators with permission to create and update contacts."
msgstr ""
"Los contactos se pueden crear y actualizar de forma masiva con la opción "
"*Importar contactos* del menú del listado de la Agenda. El diálogo describe "
"el formato, ofrece una plantilla CSV descargable y muestra el resultado de "
"cada línea. Solo se muestra a los administradores con permiso para crear y "
"actualizar contactos."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:49
msgid ""
"The file may be encoded in UTF-8, with or without BOM, or in Windows-1252, "
"so both the *CSV UTF-8* and the plain *CSV* formats of Excel are accepted. "
"Its first row must be a header naming the columns, which can be separated "
"by commas (,) or semicolons (;)."
msgstr ""
"El fichero puede estar codificado en UTF-8, con o sin BOM, o en "
"Windows-1252, de modo que se aceptan tanto el formato *CSV UTF-8* como el "
"*CSV* normal de Excel. Su primera fila debe ser una cabecera con el nombre "
"de las columnas, que se pueden separar con comas (,) o punto y coma (;)."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:56
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Columna"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:57
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Obligatoria"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:58
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notas"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:59
msgid "``id``"
msgstr "``id``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:60
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:66
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:69
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:72
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:76
#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:79
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:61
msgid ""
"With a value, the contact with that id is updated. Empty or missing, a new "
"contact is created."
msgstr ""
"Con valor, se actualiza el contacto con ese id. Vacía o ausente, se crea un "
"contacto nuevo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:62
msgid "``name``"
msgstr "``name``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:63
msgid "To create"
msgstr "Al crear"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:64
msgid "Cannot be left empty. Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "No puede quedar vacío. Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:65
msgid "``lastname``"
msgstr "``lastname``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:67
msgid "Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:68
msgid "``email``"
msgstr "``email``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:70
msgid "Valid email address. Up to 100 characters."
msgstr "Dirección de email válida. Máximo 100 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:71
msgid "``workPhoneCountry``, ``mobilePhoneCountry``"
msgstr "``workPhoneCountry``, ``mobilePhoneCountry``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:73
msgid ""
"ISO country code (for example ``ES``). When there is a phone and no country,"
" the client country is used."
msgstr ""
"Código ISO del país (por ejemplo ``ES``). Si hay teléfono y no hay país, se "
"usa el país del cliente."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:75
msgid "``workPhone``, ``mobilePhone``"
msgstr "``workPhone``, ``mobilePhone``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:77
msgid "Number without international prefix. Up to 20 characters."
msgstr "Número sin prefijo internacional. Máximo 20 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:78
msgid "``otherPhone``"
msgstr "``otherPhone``"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:80
msgid "Free text. Up to 25 characters."
msgstr "Texto libre. Máximo 25 caracteres."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:83
msgid "Example CSV file"
msgstr "Fichero CSV de ejemplo"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:91
msgid "The import follows these rules:"
msgstr "La importación sigue estas reglas:"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:93
msgid ""
"A row without id always creates a new contact, even if an identical one "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Una fila sin id siempre crea un contacto nuevo, aunque ya exista uno "
"idéntico."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:94
msgid ""
"A row with id updates that contact. If the id does not exist or belongs to "
"another client, the row fails."
msgstr ""
"Una fila con id actualiza ese contacto. Si el id no existe o pertenece a "
"otro cliente, la fila falla."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:95
msgid ""
"A column present in the header but empty in a row deletes the value of that "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Una columna presente en la cabecera pero vacía en una fila borra el valor de"
" ese campo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:96
msgid "A column missing from the header is not modified when updating."
msgstr "Una columna que no está en la cabecera no se modifica al actualizar."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:97
msgid ""
"Contacts linked to a user only update their phones and phone countries: "
"name, lastname, email and other phone are ignored, as they are kept in sync "
"with the user."
msgstr ""
"Los contactos vinculados a un usuario solo actualizan sus teléfonos y sus "
"países: el nombre, los apellidos, el email y el otro teléfono se ignoran, ya"
" que se mantienen sincronizados con el usuario."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:99
msgid ""
"Valid rows are saved and failed rows are reported with their line number in "
"the file and the reason."
msgstr ""
"Las filas válidas se guardan y las erróneas se informan con su número de "
"línea en el fichero y el motivo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:101
msgid ""
"Import again only the failed lines once fixed. Importing the whole file "
"again would duplicate the contacts created from rows without id."
msgstr ""
"Una vez corregidas, importa de nuevo solo las líneas fallidas. Importar otra"
" vez el fichero completo duplicaría los contactos creados desde filas sin "
"id."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:106
msgid "CSV Export"
msgstr "Exportación CSV"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:109
msgid ""
"The *Export contacts* option of the Address Book list menu downloads a CSV "
"file with every contact that matches the active filters, not only the ones "
"shown in the current page. It is only shown to administrators with "
"permission to read contacts."
msgstr ""
"La opción *Exportar contactos* del menú del listado de la Agenda descarga un "
"fichero CSV con todos los contactos que cumplen los filtros activos, no solo "
"los que se muestran en la página actual. Solo se muestra a los "
"administradores con permiso para leer contactos."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:113
msgid ""
"The file is meant to be edited and imported again, so it has exactly the "
"columns of the import format, in the same order, and every row has its "
"``id``. Countries are exported as ISO codes and phones without international "
"prefix, as they are stored. Contacts linked to a user are included like the "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"El fichero está pensado para editarlo y volverlo a importar, así que tiene "
"exactamente las columnas del formato de importación, en el mismo orden, y "
"cada fila lleva su ``id``. Los países se exportan como códigos ISO y los "
"teléfonos sin prefijo internacional, tal como están guardados. Los contactos "
"vinculados a un usuario se incluyen como el resto."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:117
msgid ""
"It is encoded in UTF-8 with BOM and uses semicolons (;) as separator, so it "
"opens directly in Excel keeping accents and columns."
msgstr ""
"Está codificado en UTF-8 con BOM y usa punto y coma (;) como separador, de "
"modo que se abre directamente en Excel conservando los acentos y las "
"columnas."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:120
msgid "Export, edit and import again"
msgstr "Exportar, editar y volver a importar"

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:122
msgid ""
"Export the contacts, filtering the list first if only some of them need "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Exporta los contactos, filtrando antes el listado si solo algunos necesitan "
"cambios."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:123
msgid ""
"Edit the values in the exported file keeping the ``id`` column: that is what "
"makes the import update each contact instead of creating a new one."
msgstr ""
"Edita los valores en el fichero exportado conservando la columna ``id``: es "
"lo que hace que la importación actualice cada contacto en lugar de crear uno "
"nuevo."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:125
msgid ""
"Import the file with the *Import contacts* option. The contacts that were "
"not changed are updated with their own values, so they stay as they were."
msgstr ""
"Importa el fichero con la opción *Importar contactos*. Los contactos que no "
"se han cambiado se actualizan con sus propios valores, así que quedan como "
"estaban."

#: ../../administration_portal/client/vpbx/addressbook.rst:128
msgid ""
"A phone stored without country is exported with an empty country column. "
"When the file is imported again, that phone takes the client country, as any "
"phone without country does."
msgstr ""
"Un teléfono guardado sin país se exporta con la columna de país vacía. Al "
"importar de nuevo el fichero, ese teléfono toma el país del cliente, como "
"cualquier teléfono sin país."
